{:edb/db-before-t 1263 :edb/db-after-t 1264 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534576 50 #inst "2026-10-08T01:27:01.203Z" 13194139534576 true] [17592186064157 1020 #edb/ref 17592186296520 13194139534576 true] [17592186064157 1020 #edb/ref 17592186296548 13194139534576 true] [17592186064158 1020 #edb/ref 17592186296527 13194139534576 true] [17592186064158 1020 #edb/ref 17592186296534 13194139534576 true] [17592186064158 1020 #edb/ref 17592186296555 13194139534576 true] [17592186064186 1020 #edb/ref 17592186296541 13194139534576 true] [17592186064186 1020 #edb/ref 17592186296562 13194139534576 true] [17592186064186 1020 #edb/ref 17592186296566 13194139534576 true] [17592186064186 1020 #edb/ref 17592186296569 13194139534576 true] [17592186064423 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534576 true] [17592186064423 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534576 false] [17592186064423 1100 "$\\int 6x{e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186064423 1100 "What is $\\displaystyle \\int6xe^{4x}dx$?" 13194139534576 false] [17592186064423 1145 "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 6x{e}^{4x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=6x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=6 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{4x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{1}{4}{e}^{4x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 6x\\cdot {e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x & =6x\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}{e}^{4x}-\\int \\frac{1}{4}{e}^{4x}\\cdot 6\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 6x{e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{3}{2}x{e}^{4x}-\\frac{3}{2}\\int {e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3x{e}^{4x}}{2}-\\frac{3{e}^{4x}}{8}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186064423 1145 "Use integration by parts with $u=6x$ and $dv=e^{4x}\\,dx$. Then $du=6\\,dx$ and $v=e^{4x}/4$, so\n$$\\int6xe^{4x}\\,dx=\\frac32xe^{4x}-\\frac32\\int e^{4x}\\,dx\n=\\frac32xe^{4x}-\\frac38e^{4x}+C.$$" 13194139534576 false] [17592186064424 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534576 true] [17592186064424 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534576 false] [17592186064424 1100 "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int2x\\sin (x)dx$." 13194139534576 false] [17592186064424 1100 "Calculate $\\int 2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186064424 1145 "Let $u=2x$ and $dv=\\sin x\\,dx$, so $du=2\\,dx$ and $v=-\\cos x$. Then\n$$\\int2x\\sin x\\,dx=-2x\\cos x+2\\int\\cos x\\,dx\n=-2x\\cos x+2\\sin x+C.$$" 13194139534576 false] [17592186064424 1145 "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=2x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=2 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 2x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2x\\cdot (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x))-\\int (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x))\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+2\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186293226 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296565 13194139534576 true] [17592186296520 1017 #edb/ref 17592186296521 13194139534576 true] [17592186296520 1089 "q-114290" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296520 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534576 true] [17592186296520 1100 "Calculate the integral $\\int (x-2){e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296520 1113 #uuid "b9f5f3bd-d415-52e5-9f1b-bb38086a6ea2" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296520 1145 "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int (x-2){e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x-2\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{x+3}\\, & ⟹\\,v={e}^{x+3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (x-2)\\cdot {e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x & =(x-2)\\cdot {e}^{x+3}-\\int {e}^{x+3}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (x-2){e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x & =(x-2){e}^{x+3}-\\int {e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(x-2){e}^{x+3}-{e}^{x+3}+C \\\\  & =(x-3){e}^{x+3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296521 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296522 13194139534576 true] [17592186296521 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296523 13194139534576 true] [17592186296521 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296524 13194139534576 true] [17592186296521 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296525 13194139534576 true] [17592186296521 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296526 13194139534576 true] [17592186296521 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534576 true] [17592186296521 1041 "selection" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296521 1104 #edb/ref 17592186296523 13194139534576 true] [17592186296521 1110 #uuid "93ad1935-30b8-5974-a36e-c93820cff49c" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296522 1034 "(\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+3){e}^{x+3}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296522 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296522 1111 #uuid "6fdd2990-a88d-51a1-ab65-be4f279d871e" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296523 1034 "(x-3){e}^{x+3}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296523 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296523 1111 #uuid "28b303c8-15a0-55aa-a0ed-9841637fb60e" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296524 1034 "(2x-1){e}^{x+3}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296524 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296524 1111 #uuid "435d3196-30e8-5f2f-908b-cf7d2dd171f5" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296525 1034 "(\\frac{x}{3}-6){e}^{x+3}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296525 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296525 1111 #uuid "3a772687-2592-506f-be0e-ece2b03d49d8" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296526 1034 "(\\frac{x}{2}-3){e}^{x+3}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296526 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296526 1111 #uuid "e50686c8-e28a-5133-a0f9-903b092a0508" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296527 1017 #edb/ref 17592186296528 13194139534576 true] [17592186296527 1089 "q-114299" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296527 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534576 true] [17592186296527 1100 "Calculate $\\int 2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296527 1113 #uuid "3a7ab00b-4ffd-5138-9522-884b73ab3aa8" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296527 1145 "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=2x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=2 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x & =2x\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x-\\int \\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x-\\frac{1}{2}(-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x)+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+\\frac{1}{8}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296528 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296529 13194139534576 true] [17592186296528 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296530 13194139534576 true] [17592186296528 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296531 13194139534576 true] [17592186296528 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296532 13194139534576 true] [17592186296528 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296533 13194139534576 true] [17592186296528 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534576 true] [17592186296528 1041 "selection" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296528 1104 #edb/ref 17592186296531 13194139534576 true] [17592186296528 1110 #uuid "1604448e-2914-5acb-82b1-40e3705e0735" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296529 1034 "-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}{4}+\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x}{6}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296529 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296529 1111 #uuid "5238f9f5-c379-5b42-9354-b22ead4bcdb2" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296530 1034 "-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}{8}+\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x}{2}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296530 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296530 1111 #uuid "f09d9a66-4aa4-59fd-b9a1-c5a841d35252" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296531 1034 "\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}{2}+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x}{8}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296531 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296531 1111 #uuid "11db2bd2-372a-5377-bfe9-944fcab80c37" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296532 1034 "\\frac{3x\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}{2}+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x}{4}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296532 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296532 1111 #uuid "396ff835-7b38-57bb-a2fd-11644f91946f" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296533 1034 "\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}{4}-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x}{2}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296533 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296533 1111 #uuid "998bb2a3-092d-5c86-a034-c73088604bd8" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296534 1017 #edb/ref 17592186296535 13194139534576 true] [17592186296534 1089 "q-114309" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296534 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534576 true] [17592186296534 1100 "$\\int (x+4)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296534 1113 #uuid "9f02eae8-3929-554e-892f-cc66f87ecf6a" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296534 1145 "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int (x+4)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x+4\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (x+4)\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x & =(x+4)\\cdot (-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2})-\\int (-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2})\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (x+4)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{(x+4)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{(x+4)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2}+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{4}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296535 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296536 13194139534576 true] [17592186296535 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296537 13194139534576 true] [17592186296535 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296538 13194139534576 true] [17592186296535 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296539 13194139534576 true] [17592186296535 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296540 13194139534576 true] [17592186296535 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534576 true] [17592186296535 1041 "selection" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296535 1104 #edb/ref 17592186296538 13194139534576 true] [17592186296535 1110 #uuid "d3543fc8-4567-5400-b13e-4f0ddcc3363c" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296536 1034 "-\\frac{(x+4)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{4}-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{2}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296536 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296536 1111 #uuid "4c7d07e0-64af-5e75-ad82-b431a24dc3ea" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296537 1034 "-\\frac{(x+4)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{6}-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{2}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296537 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296537 1111 #uuid "e606dc4f-085c-5e0f-b9d4-f76e42f7530b" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296538 1034 "-\\frac{(x+4)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2}+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{4}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296538 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296538 1111 #uuid "843a71ca-2a37-5f1d-b88f-0fe4cbccab94" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296539 1034 "-\\frac{(x+4)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{4}+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{8}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296539 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296539 1111 #uuid "5fd91e00-f071-5e2b-a35f-7dfb3e834f76" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296540 1034 "-\\frac{3(x+4)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2}+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{6}+C" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296540 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534576 true] [17592186296540 1111 #uuid "34f667e6-631b-5dec-928c-e51036c02907" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296541 1017 #edb/ref 17592186296542 13194139534576 true] [17592186296541 1089 "q-114322" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296541 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534576 true] [17592186296541 1100 "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296541 1113 #uuid "152d0483-02e6-512b-86fa-06dc7d5e6cb8" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296541 1145 "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x) & ⟹\\,v=-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x))-\\int (-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x))\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)}{4}+\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={-\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)}{4}|}_{0}^{\\pi }+\\frac{1}{4}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={-\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)}{4}|}_{0}^{\\pi }+{\\frac{1}{16}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =[-\\frac{\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(4\\pi )}{4}+\\frac{0\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4\\cdot 0)}{4}] \\\\  & +\\frac{1}{16}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot 0)] \\\\  & =(-\\frac{\\pi }{4}+0)+\\frac{1}{16}(0-0) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534576 true] [17592186296542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296543 13194139534576 true] [17592186296542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296544 13194139534576 true] [17592186296542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296545 13194139534576 true] [17592186296542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296546 13194139534576 true] [17592186296542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186296547 13194139534576 true] [17592186296542 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534576 true] [17592186296542 1041